node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2025-08-01T23:25:09Z","updated_at":"2025-08-06T17:16:10Z","closed_at":"2025-08-06T17:16:01Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":true,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109218","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109218","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109218.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109218.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Alternative to: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109211\r\n\r\nCan't be merged for 4.5.\r\n\r\nThis breaks compatibility even more than https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109211 does, but this may be an important change for scripting users. \r\n\r\nRight now there is no way for a user to free a local rendering device created with `create_local_rendering_device()`. All the user receives is a pointer and there is no corresponding method to free it. \r\n\r\nThis PR makes RenderingDevice inherit from RefCounted so that it can be automatically freed once there are no more references to it. This has the benefit of fixing the memory leak in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109193 (although allocating the RD in the first place is still a bug IMO).\r\n\r\nThis PR could be combined with https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109211 to both fix https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109193 and ensure that users don't leak RenderingDevices in their own code. ","closed_by":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109218/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109218/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}